  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34c4bd7e81f3efe87c922e84",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "『觉醒』，之类的吧！\n借着这势如破竹的胜利，一路冲向高潮！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e1006a3ffc0fd7e226232e1c2ad82bc90ce180d07e31e9f485c2ecc11ef0c51",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1494"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebc0aac1880497e6228a4b83",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是的，简直就像魔鬼编辑一样！　但是——\n正是多亏了那些充满热情的挑刺，我才能赢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8bb40e0754b8c770aa422b0fe91ba7cb2f1759bebb0ad9d6bb81c675b4508d82",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1495"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1b34a0606c432b7514b6724",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "大赛中伏兵和大型新人的活跃可是定番——\n我是打算作为打破常规的主角去迎战的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d75d662afefee27d6fd45294fd1839191ee4491e6c12e2984a352d51c2f9a466",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1496"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce8cc4e1d7a184a0e4a80c0b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是因为和小杏她们一起修行过了呢。\n可不能让对手看到丢脸的一面啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0b3b4c803ef33a83188af1b5ba95472e8e1c1697ca50ea3a8b74f070446478e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1497"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32d2f9de6a527ec019cf404a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "妈妈给我送来了我最爱吃的炖菜。\n力量满满，胜利已是板上钉钉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cf749c7c0a9ed60c353c23fdc028f65c4d9b78ca7f03f66d84804189a89cf03",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1498"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0d60f8abe7eed9839c405a3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "大赛中伏兵和大型新人的活跃可是定番——\n我是打算作为打破常规的主角去迎战的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d75d662afefee27d6fd45294fd1839191ee4491e6c12e2984a352d51c2f9a466",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1499"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a64f4a540c393f84f40b3c38",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当然是很开心……但如果就此满足的话，\\n会被昨天的自己耻笑的！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d6e5cc4ad557cc276a239de4d36487424204fedfd6fa30565046d08a310a4ca",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:599dce319eb4bf5e9651d207",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是因为和小杏她们一起修行过了呢。\n可不能让对手看到丢脸的一面啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0b3b4c803ef33a83188af1b5ba95472e8e1c1697ca50ea3a8b74f070446478e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1500"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:616ee24ce2ea3e0ef254fdfb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "妈妈给我送来了我最爱吃的炖菜。\n力量满满，胜利已是板上钉钉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cf749c7c0a9ed60c353c23fdc028f65c4d9b78ca7f03f66d84804189a89cf03",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1501"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1423980a7639ea9534fe5099",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最后的直线上我想起来了。粉丝们的\n信件、留言板——那上面所缀满的心意！",
      "source_fingerprint": "63a2441f68b43b699029c2732e347294f652cc8d1d89704792b6d49f03517958",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1502"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e10a59330e026f2991f407f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我们的故事，还会继续写下去的。\n敬请期待神业老师的下一部作品吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0389f293614aee00e5a6bb3ea5be45c6807177823887d670595cb4d9e22832b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1503"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26e8faa0db99ed1f86cbaa7d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最后的直线上我想起来了。粉丝们的\n信件、留言板——那上面所缀满的心意！",
      "source_fingerprint": "63a2441f68b43b699029c2732e347294f652cc8d1d89704792b6d49f03517958",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1504"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:537c6097ae8176a573de0a6a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我们的故事，还会继续写下去的。\n敬请期待神业老师的下一部作品吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0389f293614aee00e5a6bb3ea5be45c6807177823887d670595cb4d9e22832b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1505"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:256c3a7ecafc71edcc913794",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在看着粉丝送给我的迷你车哦！\n算是一种心灵护理吧……会感到很安心呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d212b46c2a9f5bc0fd59e681144a027282fc4c99306989d2521cca887e675dc1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1506"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e6ab0e192be78db36b85f3f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是那份想要成为“最强”的，执念。\n……只有这个，我是不会输给任何人的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "55763e5fb32d56cb79abf19e8756668473b8c5050e598c197fbd1c0d677ce485",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1507"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b91b58cecda33c3685ef63c2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我知道自己实力不足。所以，\n努力是理所当然的。我不想把它当做苦难。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0db3267e8e8a821efeabd6dee5a045135dc52f70b45ad39ffdd371adbb0bd9bf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1508"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac30248d43bb455788d6d305",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是的。虽然被称为“天才”的背影还很遥远\n——但我会用自己的方式，一定会追上的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b13de3e0ee04326e2e4f942b1d2d036ac53e358e7c1f7b2a220347a9c179c4c9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1509"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:154ec4e252a5887743775d4a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "耶嘿嘿……因为跑得不错就忍不住做了。\\n那个，照片请放小张一点……拜托了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0af1dc61236bcf3719e5b957663f20433240eb8dedb17e08dca84645eb61a0cb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "151"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7fd7d40092faca9f3028f63",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哇，好开心！　能有那么多人看到\n我的奔跑……莱斯莱斯，太幸福了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "722c1c7b511eccc1fce842718b5ce809f42f6423ec4a7123ab94472b07b10842",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1510"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d78dd7c0ae7630478cb48845",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我知道自己实力不足。所以，\n努力是理所当然的。我不想把它当做苦难。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0db3267e8e8a821efeabd6dee5a045135dc52f70b45ad39ffdd371adbb0bd9bf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1511"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:859c3dbb1ce98ca5595562b2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是的。虽然被称为“天才”的背影还很遥远\n——但我会用自己的方式，一定会追上的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b13de3e0ee04326e2e4f942b1d2d036ac53e358e7c1f7b2a220347a9c179c4c9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1512"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47cc3273b62689bd00c2a504",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哇，好开心！　能有那么多人看到\n我的奔跑……莱斯莱斯，太幸福了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "722c1c7b511eccc1fce842718b5ce809f42f6423ec4a7123ab94472b07b10842",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1513"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38436ac813c49e4378542f7a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "能被这样说一直都是我的梦想！\n呜……啊，对不起！　保持笑容保持笑容！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4efeb4f7fabc7b22285782042bf0e481f32e2047340cb0b30f38e93167382a49",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1514"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a8c98f8c5318cbe376ca675",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "给正在阅读这篇采访的你……！\n为你献上的奔跑，有传达给你吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "66d9eb005d88e830cc803cf8dd3e270ab002244a06981d905e0a43ba20ab29fe",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1515"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb571b3ea32014876f7971b3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这真是无愧于“最强”之名的奔跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a12ba4af3cf2908a284a167a70c26c8c968c82f70ce0cd62113f355f65fcd52a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1516"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc1c7467e20949885cce7c46",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "给正在阅读这篇采访的你……！\n为你献上的奔跑，有传达给你吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "66d9eb005d88e830cc803cf8dd3e270ab002244a06981d905e0a43ba20ab29fe",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1517"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da31a7eaae5551c22408ac1b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "用训练员准备的冰袋来调节体温。\n总是为我做准备，非常感谢他！",
      "source_fingerprint": "81d697f753f379932861c13bd04ddadb2b91f3bf0db3a556a12e14d7f62b5221",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1518"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ee80abda35a47999a58d194",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我会直直地凝视观众席。想要将大家\n闪闪发光的笑容，深深烙印在瞳孔里！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a8953523f705f0e847d0530ec6cbab20b29ec01543d8c119c1f65bb64ba7d17",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1519"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75dae185ca68b4bdc81a1158",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为我遇见了能够将我的梦想和困难，\\n全部化为力量的训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "51106a65bdbdf7a4feead303eb7291f96edd37a95e165c8de53d2edab47dd6af",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "152"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:930c1106e26724d3c680d4ab",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是房一潘多拉小姐。她说『好快～♡』！\n呵呵，决赛里我想让她更加惊讶呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a08b75a0c0a7ee1f1e6855e933c079b39d6192be5bdd0a7b3e52d9db73a7f34b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1520"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45bd27d7d0651f993e24320b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想要获胜的心情，以及希望我获胜的愿望。\n这一切的一切都让我变得更加强大！",
      "source_fingerprint": "da8fb817f379481d29bd469df2f3bfef0007b049e65cebf644c923f149cd92c6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1521"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2482f05393ba1e773e0e30e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "眼前一片明亮，想要从心底深处大喊\n『太棒啦——！』呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bdffab0e76d41ca635198207b27a05ae87e8f99c2f1be4a5d590e1c84f0bd66",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1522"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74a858f6d46df791d50a3e33",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是房一潘多拉小姐。她说『好快～♡』！\n呵呵，决赛里我想让她更加惊讶呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a08b75a0c0a7ee1f1e6855e933c079b39d6192be5bdd0a7b3e52d9db73a7f34b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1523"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2420a7d321143ead5896b924",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想要获胜的心情，以及希望我获胜的愿望。\n这一切的一切都让我变得更加强大！",
      "source_fingerprint": "da8fb817f379481d29bd469df2f3bfef0007b049e65cebf644c923f149cd92c6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1524"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63cee65509138932a7951c2e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "眼前一片明亮，想要从心底深处大喊\n『太棒啦——！』呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bdffab0e76d41ca635198207b27a05ae87e8f99c2f1be4a5d590e1c84f0bd66",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1525"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c86bcc58221e5eea362a46e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我已经证明了自己可以向更高处迈进。\n所以，增加训练量！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d145f4939db2485c78aff48f73808770ba2be6da30d0af6a0c400fc568f2cf4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1526"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bab6f78fff4ab67922f778d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真是留在记忆里的一场好赛事呢。\n这是我们共同抓住的，最棒的胜利哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbc3e02d52e586a62cedb3d1ffedd3e0f7332689dcde81cecca81eb9d515d147",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1527"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:606a2d3b1b7905d78089b9f6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我已经证明了自己可以向更高处迈进。\n所以，增加训练量！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d145f4939db2485c78aff48f73808770ba2be6da30d0af6a0c400fc568f2cf4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1528"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17612170e2b7645ead51dc02",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真是留在记忆里的一场好赛事呢。\n这是我们共同抓住的，最棒的胜利哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbc3e02d52e586a62cedb3d1ffedd3e0f7332689dcde81cecca81eb9d515d147",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1529"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bda254891fec25898c7f3cf2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我想决赛时要面对的挑战会变得更加严峻！\\n但我会加油的，还请大家声援我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "167680e523683ea98bffa6829727bcebdf99b39ecdf3df664312684e34116141",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "153"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df48b56459b71707e7ae811d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在粉丝交流会上加深交流，\n把大家的心意都塞满在胸口。",
      "source_fingerprint": "39fee967b50bbc81e449ae909fc3720b92f65b5a13a210e7ef69beecc1ceab15",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1530"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f175779e81f191ab2f2e704",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是飞往世界各地的家人发来的LANE。\n由羁绊紧紧相连的心，让我变得更加坚强。",
      "source_fingerprint": "158d4c00dabec3053ddcf9197da5b1519dadf17fa7a878d824286b980907b0d3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1531"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff6beec14dddbf4aaa87debe",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "首先……我要和训练员一起细细品味\n这次的喜悦。为了下一次能再次展翅高飞。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a91a09a010ef74aaf86650760d7a72cc3af55ffa1d21d2cab76635e24d0d59b",
