        "1538"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e87065c1edee482edbc165f4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "很幸福。能够和大家一起跑到最后，\n这种理所当然的事，比什么都宝贵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "35c5fb340b447b861ee146e3489c4689ec2caaab4c777a57d8f72fc90c1a5230",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1539"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccd00231487474c320bbdbef",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我知道大家都很强！\\n正因如此我才想要超越大家……我会超越的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d26c7cddeac4bc52053097e9ee23c9ef13fadf95cf9cd663a7238a5fb160207b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "154"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7438c01087ef7ecd9208ef0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是的——重叠的欢呼声，与我的心\n紧紧相连。一次又一次……一次又一次。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0f6728c0336ca75bb60e40e3a9118c08efdf030c0053d9959ea69588c983498",
