      "uid": "zhcn:bd036962c3a9907634051283",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我还想跑出能令自己更加满意的奔跑。\n仅此而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "33c8aafb778e1fb464c25bd29588bef3592b563572c21521fa6aeee19ebaf114",
